  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3904.02 Training Providers. Training providers who teach any of the training subjects set forth in Saf-C 3904.01 shall comply with the provisions of Fire 404.\n\nSource. #6148, eff 12-22-95; ss by #7974, eff 10-20-03, EXPIRED: 10-20-11\n\nNew. #10014, eff 10-25-11 (from Saf-C 3903.02); ss by #12966, eff 12-31-19",
